{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-08_end",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-08",
  "title": "The Promised Land Drifts",
  "storyCode": "13-10",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "918a1bd47c6acc870337bf9767a9ee07eb42343404327ad58e5f42e39dcd337e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_9"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is... a battlefield."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My battlefield, the battlefield of the 'King of Sarkaz'."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nachzehrer King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_420_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We will take this last city. Their resistance has reached an end."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You are... the king of the Nachzehrer Court."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nachzehrer King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_420_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I have no name. I am merely your loyal subject, 'King of Sarkaz'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nachzehrer King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_420_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is your fate. You will bring us salvation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nachzehrer King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_420_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All that we fervently wish for, all that we have finally achieved... salvation."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nachzehrer King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_420_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your will is our will."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nachzehrer King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_420_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You have answered the prophecy, and thus it will yield its rewards."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nachzehrer King",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_420_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Please leave it to us. This battle will not drag much longer."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You look exhausted these days."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Amiya, you can't go on like this. You need to rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Theresa?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is all of this... my doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "These are all things you need to do, Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You have come to the origin of it all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is also our fated end."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't be like this, Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'King of Sarkaz'. I personally placed this crown upon your head, and brought to you this pain... and glory."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We will face it together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is... the will of the myriad souls. We cannot deny it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The more you reject it, the more you suffer. The more you resist it, the weaker you are."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We have seen so much defiance of fate. Prophecies manifest early before those who defy it, and it is clear as day where they will ultimately fall."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We are grateful for those pointless challenges. Through their struggles they weave an ode to heroes, yet the heroes themselves are destined to perish."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The more you reject it, the more you suffer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Because you understand. All choices, all struggles, all fatigue, the sorrow you swallow, they bear no meaning. Rejecting it only embitters the gentle hand of fate."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The more you resist it, the weaker you are."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Because you realize. All fights, all resistance, the blood we spill, our haggard words, they have no destination. Resistance only fills your destined home with thorns."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why bother... why bother."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We only wish for you to rest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Close your eyes, Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_light"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_battlefield"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya?",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'I see you, black crown on your head, melting millions of lives, into nothing but memories.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya?",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'I see the, King of Sarkaz, enslaving all peoples, everywhere.'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya?",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya?",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You will regret."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya?",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You will fall in regret, just like me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya?",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The final destination... is still here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya?",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When death approaches, you will realize, that all prophecies, are inevitable."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya?",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I... am the most horrific disaster to afflict our world."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then, I will kill you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Even if, you are me, you are the 'Lord of Fiends'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya?",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I once... made the same choice as you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya?",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I thought that I was strong enough, powerful enough to unbind myself from fate's shackles."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya?",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You can't do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya?",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Amiya... you can't do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Really."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You may have tried once, you may have faced all sorts of bitterness and still fallen into the same abyss in the end."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I haven't."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I have not walked on your so-called 'fated path'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I will challenge you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I will challenge you, in my, the King of Sarkaz's name, 'Amiya'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If the end of it all was set in stone long ago by those prophecies you espouse, if the meaning of our lives are just to prove your inevitable conclusion..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then why do we live?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why do we exist?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Patriot's lifelong struggle, Dr. Kal'tsit's assiduous choices, Dr. {@nickname} holding my hand and affirming our path—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All this just to become a footnote in fate's manuscript?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I refuse to accept it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Amiya, this will only beget pain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It will be, an endless torture."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Myriad souls of Kazdel, I ask you. Did Theresa break out of her own fate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Even Theresis, did he face you head on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Theresa?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_056",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Theresa... She handed over this crown to me, for this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She didn't believe in the predestined tragic future that you paint."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Myriad Souls?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_015",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So she is suffering now... Listening to our voices with nary a rest!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Myriad Souls?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_015",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If only to relieve her burden, 'King of Sarkaz', you must—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Theresa doesn't need any rescue."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The 'King of Sarkaz' will no longer be a symbol of conquest and revenge."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Maybe... that's why I must be the one."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Myriad Souls?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_015",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How arrogant, how conceited—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, it is only because I have worn this black crown, that I brandish my sword at you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz Myriad Souls?",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_015",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You cannot escape fate's choice. The further you run from it, the faster it will come—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I won't run."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll wait here for it. 'Fate'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When your plans have dissipated, when your taunts fall short."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll show you all—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We... The peoples of this great land, can choose an ending for ourselves."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_a"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mm—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Amiya, you're awake!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Do you feel alright? Any pain?\nYou got hit by Confessarius witchcraft. Did you have a nightmare?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm fine now."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...The 'King of Sarkaz'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Doctor, this power is not a curse. It's not forbidden witchcraft that brings disaster."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Theresa passed it to me, so that... we can use it to find our own path."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I trust you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're up, Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's fine... Logos."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whether or not I was caught by Confessarius witchcraft, I would have had to face this... self-reflection eventually."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In my dream, those voices proclaimed the prophecy again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Prophecy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes... The prophecy The Patriot spoke of before he died."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No matter what voices they were, it's all a trick of the Confessarii."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't worry about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Was that a method of Confessarius torture, or are the myriad souls still deeply connected to my heart?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Or maybe I... still hold on to that scary prophecy deep down inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's not important, though. I already rejected their offer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I still want you to get a full checkup from Dr. Kal'tsit, though. Your rings..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Um, Logos, where are we though...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Logos requisitioned the use of this Sarkaz transport squad's vehicle. In the name of the Lord of the Banshees.\nWe need to escape the Confessarii pursuit."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yesterday, Closure's drones found us. W's safehouse that they were staying at were also attacked by the Confessarii, and Nightingale was captured."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...The Confessarii."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We let our guard down against this Sarkaz squad named after the Confessarii. Theresis's plan also allowed them freedom of movement."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "However, they've finally left the shadows they've been hiding in."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Doctor, Paprika and the others are loading the Originium samples you need on board. But they're still wary of us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right now, they're only listening to me because they fear me. I might have to resort to threatening them with real curses soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Five batches of crystals should be enough. Amiya's recovered as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1072_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then, we will head to Brentwood next and meet up with Dr. Kal'tsit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Doctor, you look uneasy... What's worrying you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I fear that Theresis isn't looking for any sort of Vampire witchcraft device.\nWhat he wants is... an even more unsettling power."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
